## VERDICT
**ALREADY_FIXED** (path-A). No source change this turn.

`c_guard_scan_idents` walks C arg text with `char_at` for classification
only, then takes **one** `str_slice(args, start, i)` per ident span.
There is no `name = name + c` / per-char OoStr concat in the ident walk.
`.oo` has no char stack array; the alpha honesty for “stack buffer”
is slice-once-per-token (same close as `t1_memory.oot` M-SG1/M-SG2).

Monofile `c_emit_secret_guard.oo` = **200** lines (≤600; under soft 256).

